<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wheelabrator cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wheelabrator cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it reduced the rating on Wheelabrator Technologies Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to 12-5/8.</p>
</text>
